{
    "title": "StarMaker: Sing Karaoke Songs",
    "description": "Cheryl Porter is on StarMaker! Bring out the singer in you in StarMaker, the popular karaoke app featured on both Google Play and the App Store\ud83c\udfc6\r\n\r\nAs a renowned singing app and music community that boasts over 50 million users worldwide, StarMaker allows you to refine your voice and showcase your music talents. Do vocal exercises with the world's #1 vocal coach Cheryl Porter, learn how to improve breathing and rhythm, and get useful tips for singing in her live stream. \r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf1f Enhanced Singing Experience</b>\r\nHost online karaoke parties with your friends in Party Rooms. Sing and listen to songs with new friends using the Live Duet feature to connect with the world seamlessly through music. Adopt news features to improve your breathing and become a rhythm master. Whether you are a novice or seeking to enhance your skills, StarMaker offers extensive training tailored to elevate your singing proficiency.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udccc Professional Sound Effects</b>\r\nSupported by our professional music team, the audio editor function offers you the chance to get varied sound effects when recording songs. Add sound effects you like, adjust the pitch based on your vocal range, and denoise or reduce latency to have a smooth and professional vocal performance.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udfa4Sing Karaoke Songs</b>\r\nWhether you like Pop, Hip Hop, R&B, or Folk, you can pick your favourite songs from millions of songs in our library, sing along with the high-quality music and scrolling lyrics, and edit your recordings with professional video filters and audio editing tools. You also get to duet with top artists and sing with your friends just like in a real karaoke room!\r\n\r\n<b>With this popular singing app and social music community, you can: </b> \r\n \ud83c\udfa4 Pick your favourite songs and latest hits from millions of local and international songs, all with scrolling lyrics. \r\n \ud83c\udfa4 Correct your pitch using the audio editor and sound like a pro singer! You can also download your recording and listen to it for free. \r\n \ud83c\udfa4 Create unique music videos using video templates which allow lyrics to be displayed beautifully on screen. \r\n \ud83c\udfa4 Edit your own video recordings with beautiful filters. \r\n \ud83c\udfa4 Join a Family. Families are where like-minded music lovers gather. Like, comment, and send gifts to one another to make friends! \r\n \ud83c\udfa4 Share your covers on TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, Snapchat, Twitter, WhatsApp, and more!\r\n\r\n<b> Sing and listen from all the hit songs now Including:</b>\r\n+Heat Waves - Glass Animals\r\n+Stay - The Kid LAROI & Justin Bieber\r\n+Easy On Me - Adele\r\n+Ghost - Justin Bieber\r\n+Shivers - Ed Sheeran\r\n+Bad Habits - Ed Sheeran\r\n+Cold Heart (PNAU Remix) - Elton John & Dua Lipa\r\n+Thats What I Want - Lil Nas X\r\n+Need To Know - Doja Cat\r\n\r\nSTAY CONNECTED!\r\nHaving trouble music downloading or singing? Contact our customer service at appsupport@starmakerinteractive.com, we'll be happy to help and answer all your questions!\r\nSing Songs - StarMaker Karaoke Official Website: \r\nhttps://www.starmakerstudios.com/\r\nLike us on Facebook\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/starmaker\r\nFollow us on Instagram\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/starmaker_app\r\nSubscribe to our YouTube Channel\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/StarMakerNetwork\r\n\r\nLearn to sing karaoke songs with Cheryl Porter & play with the StarMaker App! To sing, to play, to connect!\r\n\r\n\u203b Permissions\r\n\r\n[Optional]\r\n- Storage: Save photos and videos from StarMaker to your device.\r\n- Contacts: Access your device's contacts and add friends.\r\n- Photos/Media: Access your gallery, take photos, and record videos.\r\n- Microphone: Recording and playback for singing, in Party Rooms, or live streams.\r\n- Location: Location-based services, such as adding friends based on location.\r\n- Calendar: Add Activity reminders to your calendar.\r\n- Bluetooth: Connect to wireless audio devices (for recording, playback, etc.).\r\n\r\n* You can still use the app even if you do not grant optional permissions.\r\n* If you choose not to grant optional permissions, some features may not work properly.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Cheryl Porter is on StarMaker! Bring out the singer in you in StarMaker, the popular karaoke app featured on both Google Play and the App Store\ud83c\udfc6<br><br>As a renowned singing app and music community that boasts over 50 million users worldwide, StarMaker allows you to refine your voice and showcase your music talents. Do vocal exercises with the world&#39;s #1 vocal coach Cheryl Porter, learn how to improve breathing and rhythm, and get useful tips for singing in her live stream. <br><br><b>\ud83c\udf1f Enhanced Singing Experience</b><br>Host online karaoke parties with your friends in Party Rooms. Sing and listen to songs with new friends using the Live Duet feature to connect with the world seamlessly through music. Adopt news features to improve your breathing and become a rhythm master. Whether you are a novice or seeking to enhance your skills, StarMaker offers extensive training tailored to elevate your singing proficiency.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udccc Professional Sound Effects</b><br>Supported by our professional music team, the audio editor function offers you the chance to get varied sound effects when recording songs. Add sound effects you like, adjust the pitch based on your vocal range, and denoise or reduce latency to have a smooth and professional vocal performance.<br><br><b>\ud83c\udfa4Sing Karaoke Songs</b><br>Whether you like Pop, Hip Hop, R&amp;B, or Folk, you can pick your favourite songs from millions of songs in our library, sing along with the high-quality music and scrolling lyrics, and edit your recordings with professional video filters and audio editing tools. You also get to duet with top artists and sing with your friends just like in a real karaoke room!<br><br><b>With this popular singing app and social music community, you can: </b> <br> \ud83c\udfa4 Pick your favourite songs and latest hits from millions of local and international songs, all with scrolling lyrics. <br> \ud83c\udfa4 Correct your pitch using the audio editor and sound like a pro singer! You can also download your recording and listen to it for free. <br> \ud83c\udfa4 Create unique music videos using video templates which allow lyrics to be displayed beautifully on screen. <br> \ud83c\udfa4 Edit your own video recordings with beautiful filters. <br> \ud83c\udfa4 Join a Family. Families are where like-minded music lovers gather. Like, comment, and send gifts to one another to make friends! <br> \ud83c\udfa4 Share your covers on TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, Snapchat, Twitter, WhatsApp, and more!<br><br><b> Sing and listen from all the hit songs now Including:</b><br>+Heat Waves - Glass Animals<br>+Stay - The Kid LAROI &amp; Justin Bieber<br>+Easy On Me - Adele<br>+Ghost - Justin Bieber<br>+Shivers - Ed Sheeran<br>+Bad Habits - Ed Sheeran<br>+Cold Heart (PNAU Remix) - Elton John &amp; Dua Lipa<br>+Thats What I Want - Lil Nas X<br>+Need To Know - Doja Cat<br><br>STAY CONNECTED!<br>Having trouble music downloading or singing? Contact our customer service at appsupport@starmakerinteractive.com, we&#39;ll be happy to help and answer all your questions!<br>Sing Songs - StarMaker Karaoke Official Website: <br>https://www.starmakerstudios.com/<br>Like us on Facebook<br>https://www.facebook.com/starmaker<br>Follow us on Instagram<br>https://www.instagram.com/starmaker_app<br>Subscribe to our YouTube Channel<br>https://www.youtube.com/user/StarMakerNetwork<br><br>Learn to sing karaoke songs with Cheryl Porter &amp; play with the StarMaker App! To sing, to play, to connect!<br><br>\u203b Permissions<br><br>[Optional]<br>- Storage: Save photos and videos from StarMaker to your device.<br>- Contacts: Access your device&#39;s contacts and add friends.<br>- Photos/Media: Access your gallery, take photos, and record videos.<br>- Microphone: Recording and playback for singing, in Party Rooms, or live streams.<br>- Location: Location-based services, such as adding friends based on location.<br>- Calendar: Add Activity reminders to your calendar.<br>- Bluetooth: Connect to wireless audio devices (for recording, playback, etc.).<br><br>* You can still use the app even if you do not grant optional permissions.<br>* If you choose not to grant optional permissions, some features may not work properly.",
